{
    "title": "Solitaire Classic",
    "description": "Solitaire Classic from Mint Games is a classic solitaire card game.\r\n \r\nclassic Solitaire is a puzzle game, and playing classic solitaire can train your brain. It is just an offline game that can be played anytime and anywhere. Download now to play the best classic Solitaire card game for free!\r\n\r\nSolitaire Card Game, enjoy your time and train your brain in this card game!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fHow to Play\ud83c\udf1f\r\nThere are seven piles of cards. The top card in each pile is visible with its suit facing up. If the card you want is hidden, you can move cards around until finding the wanted one. Then you drag the card and put it into the desired card slot. If one of the seven piles is cleared, you can place a K card in this empty pile.\r\n\r\n \r\n If you have a solitaire card that's hidden, you can move solitaire cards around until you find places that you can hold and grab the desired solitaire card and, eventually, put it in the desired slot.\r\n\r\n If you use all the solitaire cards in one of the seven piles, you may place a king in the empty space.\r\n \r\n \ud83c\udf1fHighlights\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\u2660 Easy mode (turning 1 card at a time) or hard mode (turning 3 cards at a time). If you get stuck in a game, try starting a new one!\r\n\u2660 Different levels of daily challenges\r\n\u2660 Standard scoring system\r\n\u2660 Timer, moves and statistics\r\n\u2660 Smart hints show potentially useful moves\r\n\u2660 Unlimited undos\r\n\u2660 Auto-complete option helps you finish a solved game\r\n\u2660 Interesting and challenging achievements\r\n\u2660 Play a random game, or restart a game that you have won before\r\n\u2660 Left-handed option and right-handed option\r\n\u2660 Play games offline anytime and anywhere\r\n\r\nWith many exquisite designs added, Solitaire Classic from Mint Games will give you a great solitaire experience!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fKey Features\ud83c\udf1f \r\n\u2660 14 kinds of game backgrounds\r\n \u2660 31 kinds of card backgrounds\r\n \u2660 Simple, beautiful and easy-to-read cards\r\n \u2660 Portrait or landscape mode\r\n \u2660 Efficient, fast, and sensible card game interface\r\n \u2660 Use your photos to customize game background and card background\r\n\r\nNow comes this popular card game for players of any age! Solitaire Classic from Mint Games does not require Wi-Fi, and you can play it whenever and wherever you want.\r\n\r\nDownload and try out this card game for free, and play with your friends now!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fMore card games from Mint Games\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\u2660 Spider Solitaire\r\n\u2666 Solitaire Card Game\r\n\u2663 Solitaire Journey\r\n\u2665 Freecell Solitaire\r\n\r\n\r\nContact Mint Games\uff1a\r\nmimintgames@gmail.com",
